<title>CANADA: Alberta Wheat Pool details harvest progress Nov 1.</title>
<headline>Alberta Wheat Pool details harvest progress Nov 1.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alberta Wheat Pool on Friday detailed the level of harvest progress to Nov 1.</p>
<p>CROP			COMBINED (PCT)</p>
<p>Hard Red Spring Wheat     92</p>
<p>Cnd Prairie Spring Wheat  90 Soft White Spring Wheat  100 Winter Wheat		 100</p>
<p>Durum Wheat		  100</p>
<p>Oats			    88</p>
<p>Barley			  94</p>
<p>Flax			    75</p>
<p>Fall Rye			97</p>
<p>Canola			  96</p>
<p>Total			   93</p>
<p>-- Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548</p>
</text>
